<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-RIETUMU CHANGES BOURSE INDEX COMPANIES.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-RIETUMU CHANGES BOURSE INDEX COMPANIES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rietumu Bank said on Thursday that Liepajas Metalurgs and Roja fish cannery will be included in the list of companies used to calculate its Rietumu-16 stock market index and Riga Jewellery and Rigas alus has been dropped.</p>
<p>The changes come into effect from today, the bank added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
